# Sentry Config File
.env.sentry-build-plugin

# convex generated files
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored. `npx convex deploy --cmd 'npm run build'` runs the
# build command BEFORE it generates this directory, so `next build` cannot import
# `convex/_generated/api` unless the files are already present. Generating them
# inside the build script instead starts a second Convex push while `convex
# deploy`'s own push is in flight, which fails with
# `409 ExistingModuleHashConflict`.
#
# Committing them means the build needs no codegen and `convex deploy` is the only
# thing that pushes. Regenerate with `npx convex codegen` (or let `npx convex dev`
# do it) and commit the result whenever anything under `convex/` changes.

#vscode
.vscode

# local implementation notes
/steps
/.swc
